     A*                                     T0SFL probe: cond ind + SFL.
     A*                                     See tools/gen/dspf.mjs. V1 only.
     A*                                     2026-09-26 real-hw fixes:
     A*                                     (1) R SFL1 was missing the SFL
     A*                                     keyword (col45, same line as R -
     A*                                     IBM Docs confirmed), so SFL1CTL's
     A*                                     SFLCTL(SFL1) could not find a
     A*                                     valid subfile record (CPD7835),
     A*                                     which then invalidated every
     A*                                     other SFL*-keyword on SFL1CTL.
     A*                                     (2) the MORE DATA line wrongly
     A*                                     had col7='O' (an A/O relation
     A*                                     marker, valid only when
     A*                                     continuing indicator conditions
     A*                                     for the SAME preceding field/
     A*                                     constant) - removed, since this
     A*                                     is its own independent constant.
     A*                                     Cond-ind column position itself
     A*                                     (col8-16, see dspf.mjs) is STILL
     A*                                     unconfirmed pending a re-run.
     A                                      CA03(03)
     A          R SFL1                      SFL
     A            KNAME         10A  O  5 10
     A          R SFL1CTL                   SFLCTL(SFL1)
     A                                      SFLSIZ(10)
     A                                      SFLPAG(5)
     A  91                                  SFLDSP
     A  90                                  SFLDSPCTL
     A  92                                  SFLCLR
     A                                      SFLEND
     A                                      SFLRCDNBR(*ALL)
     A  95                              3 10NO DATA
     A N95                              3 10MORE DATA
